{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06207","headline":"同王昌龄裴迪游青龙寺昙壁上人兄院集和兄维 · 王缙","name":"同王昌龄裴迪游青龙寺昙壁上人兄院集和兄维","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林中空寂舍，阶下终南山。\n高卧一牀上，回看六合间。\n浮云几处灭，飞鸟何时还？\n问义天人接，无心世界闲。\n谁知大隐者，兄弟自追攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王缙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}